# The public EigenTrajectory clone + its datasets and pretrained checkpoints (~100 MB,
# fetched by hand -- see docs/m6.6-predictor-study.md). Never in git -- except our own
# eigen.py shim inside it, which is what makes the adapter load the public model.
detection_pipeline/EigenTrajectory/*
!detection_pipeline/EigenTrajectory/eigen.py

# The AGX's EigenTrajectory weights tarball (155 MB, fetched by hand, byte-identical
# public checkpoints -- see docs/m6.6-predictor-study.md Sec. 8). Never in git: it is
# over GitHub's 100 MB file limit, and CLAUDE.md warns against `git add -A` here.
weights/
